SUMMARY:Fourth of July Double Feature
DESCRIPTION:Jazz Brunch 11:30am-2:30pm\nClouds of Delusion 4-7pm\n\n4th of July is going to be a great day here at the brewery and we hope you’ll all join us for some fun during the day before the nighttime festivities pop off ! We’ve got a double feature of live music\, starting with Jazz Brunch from 11:30am-2:30pm\, then we’re super excited to have Clouds of Delusion take over the taproom for a special 4th of July show playing all of your favorite dead tunes. Clouds will play from 4-7 to be sure that everyone who wants to fit it all in has time to get down to fireworks. We’ll be slinging drinks all day and the pizza shop has the brunch menu going all afternoon until 2:30 then switches over to the full pizza shop menu. We hope you’ll join us for the fun! Free live music\, free parking\, family and pet-friendly. See you there! \nJazz Brunch Info: We’ll have an extra special brunch menu\, craft beer\, mimosas\, and of course\, beer-mosas\, all alongside jazz music from the talented jazz fusion trio\, “Four Peanuts”. The group explores both original compositions and zesty covers of tunes you may or may not know. The trio features Alex Taub on keyboards\, Brennan Dugan on bass\, and Joe Enright on drums\, and will certainly leave your peanuts salted and boiled to perfection! \nClouds of Delusion Info: Grateful Dead Tribute Band composed of young Asheville locals\, and members of our amazing FB community! Come on out to support this amazing group! Clouds of Delusion is a band centered around Grateful Dead music and the wider catalog of jam band influence. A 5-piece band\, they are fascinated by the improv\, smitten with the songs and dedicated to the dance party! Come out and shake it! Check the band out on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/cloudsofdelusionofficial?igsh=djJhb255ZW5jdXJk\n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/fourth-of-july-double-feature/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Red-White-and-Blue-Bold-Modern-4th-July-Event-Flyer-16-scaled-1-e1782852252305.png
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=French Broad River Brewery 101 Fairview Rd Asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=101 Fairview Rd:geo:-82.5374054,35.5662722
END:VEVENT
