SUMMARY:Independence Day Block Party
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Downtown July 4 Celebration is still happening in Downtown Asheville—and we’re bringing the party to the South Slope!\n\n\nWe’re thrilled to announce that Empire Strikes Brass will headline the Asheville Yards Stage at 7:00 PM as part of the Independence Day Block Party on Saturday\, July 4.\n\n\nFrom DJs and live music to Hoop Jam performances\, banjo pickin’\, and family-friendly entertainment throughout the district\, there will be something for everyone all day long.\n\n\n Empire Strikes Brass – 7:00 PM\n DJs\n Hoop Jam\n Banjo Music\n Live performances throughout the South Slope\n Dock Dogs\n Food vendors\n Marketplace vendors\n Car Show\n Fireworks at 9:30 PM\n\n\nThe tradition continues— in one of Downtown Asheville’s most vibrant neighborhoods.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/independence-day-block-party-presented-by-ingles/
LOCATION:Asheville’s South Slope\, 75 Coxe Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
